@startuml state-report
!include _style.iuml
title Report lifecycle (BR-05, ReportStateMachine)

[*] --> SUBMITTED : submit [resident, valid, not duplicate]\n/ reference, notify officials
[*] --> DUPLICATE : submit [open same-category report\n≤100 m, ≤72 h] / link parent
SUBMITTED --> UNDER_REVIEW : triage [official of dept]
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED : reject [reason ≥10]
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : reject [reason ≥10]
UNDER_REVIEW --> IN_PROGRESS : assign [no active task,\neligible worker] / create Task
ESCALATED --> IN_PROGRESS : assign / reassign
IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : reassign / old task REASSIGNED
SUBMITTED --> ESCALATED : escalate [SLA exceeded | official + reason]
UNDER_REVIEW --> ESCALATED : escalate
IN_PROGRESS --> ESCALATED : escalate
IN_PROGRESS --> RESOLVED : completeTask [assignee, notes, proof]\n/ resolvedAt
ESCALATED --> RESOLVED : completeTask
RESOLVED --> CLOSED : confirm [reporter, ≤7 days]\n| autoClose [>7 days]
RESOLVED --> UNDER_REVIEW : reopen [reporter, ≤7 days, reason]
CLOSED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
DUPLICATE --> [*]

state ESCALATED #fee2e2
state RESOLVED #dcfce7
state DUPLICATE #ede9fe
note right of IN_PROGRESS
  Every transition appends an immutable
  history entry and notifies the reporter
  and followers (FR-15).
end note
@enduml
